    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_03",
      "hash": "8107bbd0a1e3bb43",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "可以让大针蜂超级进化的大针蜂进化石，\\n售价₽[VAR NUM5(0000,0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_04",
      "hash": "8107c0d0a1e3c3c2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "可以让大比鸟超级进化的大比鸟进化石，\\n售价₽[VAR NUM5(0000,0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_05",
      "hash": "8107c1d0a1e3c575",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "可以让胡地超级进化的胡地进化石，\\n售价₽[VAR NUM5(0000,0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_06",
      "hash": "8107bed0a1e3c05c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "可以让呆壳兽超级进化的呆壳兽进化石，\\n售价₽[VAR NUM5(0000,0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
