      "hash": "810ac2d0a1e5fcff",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "可以让暴鲤龙超级进化的暴鲤龙进化石，\\n售价₽[VAR NUM5(0000,0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_sub070_pokemaniac_11",
      "hash": "810ac1d0a1e5fb4c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "可以让化石翼龙超级进化的化石翼龙进化石，\\n售价₽[VAR NUM5(0000,0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_sub070_select_11",
      "hash": "f251523d00375a52",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "购买"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_sub070_select_12",
